                                "sense_id": "ff1ea940-48ac-397a-a3d4-21dd764a10c5",
                                "text": "What I said in my epistle to my reverend friend and master, Doctor James, the incomparably industrious and learned bibliothecary of Oxford, I profess still; but I hold those canons of the apostles uncanonical."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "03bbcef3-55be-4e26-8c99-e80f446f7377",
                                "sense_id": "ff1ea940-48ac-397a-a3d4-21dd764a10c5",
                                "text": "He was also that rare thing, a connoisseur of the uncanonical hybrid in art, as demonstrated by the presence of a headdress mask of a water spirit from Sierra Leone."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
